  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html",
  "prefLabel": "He-P 3303.02 Eligible Foods",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3303.02 Eligible Foods.\n\n(a) Eligible foods shall comply with 7 CFR 248.8(a).\n\n(b) Eligible foods shall:\n\n(1) Be grown within the state of New Hampshire; and\n\n(2) Include fresh, unprepared, locally grown fruits, vegetables, and cut herbs.\n\n(c) In accordance with 7 CFR 248.8(a), the following foods shall be considered ineligible:\n\n(1) Honey:\n\n(2) Maple syrup:\n\n(3) Cider;\n\n(4) Nuts and seeds;\n\n(5) Eggs;\n\n(6) Cheese;\n\n(7) Meats;\n\n(8) Seafood;\n\n(9) Dried herbs;\n\n(10) Herb plants;\n\n(11) Pickled vegetables;\n\n(12) Those foods grown outside the state of New Hampshire, the United States and its territories; and\n\n(13) Other foods identified as not eligible by the FNS.\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html"
}
